boson_sdk/*
!boson_sdk/README.md

# Legacy duplicate of the same proprietary Boson SDK, from before it was
# consolidated into boson_sdk/ above (see boson_sdk_wrapper.py's
# LEGACY_SDK_ROOT fallback). Same "not ours to distribute" rationale.
3.0 IDD & SDK/

